  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"由 Serilum 開發。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 與 Neo 提供大量活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>Extended Bone Meal 是一款極簡風格模組，擴大了骨粉的應用範圍。使用骨粉即可讓<em>地獄疣、仙人掌、藤蔓與甘蔗</em>生長。按住潛行鍵時使用骨粉，可使作物瞬間成熟。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的生活品質套件\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"適用環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>使用骨粉種植地獄疣：</strong><br></span></p>\n<details><summary>展開詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/extended-bone-meal/a.webp\" alt=\"gif1\" width=\"844\" height=\"474\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong>使用骨粉種植甘蔗、仙人掌與藤蔓：</strong><br></span></p>\n<details><summary>展開詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/extended-bone-meal/b.webp\" alt=\"gif2\" width=\"848\" height=\"476\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong>按住潛行鍵並使用骨粉，使作物瞬間達到成熟階段：</strong><br></span></p>\n<details><summary>展開詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/extended-bone-meal/c.webp\" alt=\"gif3\" width=\"846\" height=\"470\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台內，您可自由在任何整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的總覽與更多詳細資訊。</span><br><span><br>若您有任何問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a> 提出。感謝您的支持！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
